n comparable issues are at the forefront of contemporary Western philosophy, in both analytic and continental traditions (as well as in their interaction), these classical and medieval Indian debates widen and globalise such discussions. This book brings to a wider audience the sophisticated range of positions held by various systems of thought in classical India.\"--Publisher's website."},"latest_revision":13,"revision":13,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2011-12-28T11:32:42.470750"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2025-12-23T22:33:47.544986"}}},"ISBN:9780835602143":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9780835602143","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL5416848M/The_wisdom_of_the_Vedas.","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL5416848M/The_wisdom_of_the_Vedas.","details":{"publishers":["Theosophical Pub. House"],"number_of_pages":99,"isbn_10":["0835602141"],"lc_classifications":["BL1115 .C45 1973","BL1115"],"key":"/books/OL5416848M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL179565A","name":"Jagadish Chandra Chatterji"}],"publish_places":["Wheaton, Ill"],"pagination":"99 p.","source_records":["marc:marc_records_scriblio_net/part07.dat:107266655:723","marc:marc_loc_updates/v37.i39.records.utf8:1960454:722","marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part08.utf8:5424684:722","bwb:9780835602143","marc:marc_columbia/Columbia-extract-20221130-010.mrc:234976115:1035","promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2024-11-12:S0-BSG-825"],"title":"The wisdom of the Vedas.","dewey_decimal_class":["294.5/921"],"notes":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Published in 1931 under title: India's outlook on life."},"identifiers":{"goodreads":["5160832"]},"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"lccn":["73008889"],"subjects":["Vedas","Philosophy, Hindu"],"publish_date":"1973","publish_country":"ilu","by_statement":"With an introd. by John Dewey.","work_title":["India's outlook on life"],"works":[{"key":"/works/OL1627098W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"oclc_numbers":["640933"],"local_id"